<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Typescript on YuCheng's Site</title><link>https://blog.tigernaxo.com/posts/typescript/</link><description>Recent content in Typescript on YuCheng's Site</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 20 May 2020 09:37:18 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.tigernaxo.com/posts/typescript/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[TS] Typescript 在標準內建物件加上屬性</title><link>https://blog.tigernaxo.com/posts/typescript/ts-extend-global-obj/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2020 09:37:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.tigernaxo.com/posts/typescript/ts-extend-global-obj/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="宣告"&gt;宣告&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;這個動作是 Extends Array Interface&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class="language-ts"&gt;interface Array&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; {
newfunc(o: T): Array&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;;
}
Array.prototype.newfunc = function (o) {
// some code
return this;
}
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;h3 id="使用"&gt;使用&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;使用者要先拿到被 extend 的 interface&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class="language-ts"&gt;declare global {
interface Array&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; {
newfunc(o: T): Array&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;;
}
}
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
